    "provenance": {
        "terms": "https://filexfer.ups.com/assets/resources/webcontent/en_US/ups_api_access_agreement.pdf",
        "policy": "https://developer.ups.com/pricing?loc=en_US",
        "verifiedAt": "2026-11-10",
        "declaredBy": "maintainer",
        "contact": "https://developer.ups.com/pricing",
        "notes": "UPS API Access Agreement (version 052024). Each API also has a per-minute spike arrest (429 until the next minute) whose figure is not published. Tracking only for packages the user ships with UPS (\"abusing or data mining the API\" revokes access; tracking business rules). Shipping Information goes only to the shipper or a person with a bona fide interest in the shipment: no aggregation across shippers, no database, no carrier comparison, no private label (sections 3(c), 4(b), 4(d)). Locator results discarded at the end of each session. Data shown in its entirety, every service level returned shown, no delivery date of one's own. Each merchant uses its own credentials and accepts the UPS terms. No idempotency key on Ship, Void or Paperless: a shipment is sent once."
    }
